### Exact API Names Mentioned
| Category | APIs |
|---|---|
| Build system | `torch.utils.cpp_extension`, `CppExtension`, `CUDAExtension`, `BuildExtension`, `load_inline`, `bdist_wheel`, `py_limited_api` |
| C++ registration (stable) | `STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY`, `STABLE_TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL`, `TORCH_BOX()`, `torch::stable::Tensor`, `STD_TORCH_CHECK`, `TORCH_ERROR_CODE_CHECK` |
